{"title":"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Alice chooses a set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> of positive integers. Then Bob lists all finite nonempty sets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> of positive integers with the property that the maximum element of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> belongs to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. Bob's list has 2024 sets. Find the sum of the elements of A.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> be one of the elements in Alices set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> of positive integers. The number of sets that Bob lists with the property that their maximum element is k is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d4f26614a4233b3c4b29e6e33a1729227be3cc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{k-1}$\" width=\"32\" height=\"15\" />, since every positive integer less than k can be in the set or out. Thus, for the number of sets bob have listed to be 2024, we want to find a sum of unique powers of two that can achieve this. 2024 is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/d/4cd18378185989f8886bc01f7a11edaf96f12406.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{10}+2^9+2^8+2^7+2^6+2^5+2^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"258\" height=\"18\" />. We must increase each power by 1 to find the elements in set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, which are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/9/0495f2ef2d371d1f27f799c00146790113bc9780.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(11,10,9,8,7,6,4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"146\" height=\"20\" />. Add these up to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/2/612c417525ad45d15df43d42199cf0ab279fd16a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{055}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" />. -westwoodmonster\n</p><p>Note: The power of two expansion can be found from the binary form of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5711c8d31d3bc3119aba377c9bda0f9dfb14e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e5328376fa4631319fdcba1a9671a587e747a7a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11111101000_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"17\" />. ~cxsmi\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/9/dd9e921d1a0d5094382c21fb2ca9b873de901542.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\left\\{ a_1, a_2, \\cdots, a_n \\right\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"162\" height=\"20\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/1/5214ae0e0ea07dc3f4fa0d3b0fc04e7e0b7e6e2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 &lt; a_2 &lt; \\cdots &lt; a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>If the maximum element of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/d/7dd5f4d0a310fee447e8fd0fa79369440b3ebf8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i \\in \\left\\{ 1, 2, \\cdots , n \\right\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"129\" height=\"20\" />, then each element in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/2/9120b3821496e568837f4a5098ecd02d69595e6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\{ 1, 2, \\cdots, a_i- 1 \\right\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" /> can be either in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> or not in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />.\nTherefore, the number of such sets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/1/4b1ed500592871e6cb03aa8175425381766ff217.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{a_i - 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, the total number of sets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is\n\\begin{align*}\n\\sum_{i=1}^n 2^{a_i - 1} &amp; = 2024 .\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>Thus\n\\begin{align*}\n\\sum_{i=1}^n 2^{a_i} &amp; = 4048 .\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>Now, the problem becomes writing 4048 in base 2, say, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/5/8e5f0f5d5e8472ba34d8b9089e1cf3d65c10b10d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4048 = \\left( \\cdots b_2b_1b_0 \\right)_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"154\" height=\"21\" />.\nWe have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/c/06ce7a112807d75a29881359c2958fd2d7c590b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\left\\{ j \\geq 1: b_j = 1 \\right\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"163\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/3/7136f4f5a78435aa08f1488b7813b7796e2a5044.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4048 = \\left( 111,111,010,000 \\right)_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"217\" height=\"21\" />.\nTherefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7c12b62a9535f277f751cec29a961b39264f36b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\left\\{ 4, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11 \\right\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"188\" height=\"20\" />.\nTherefore, the sum of all elements in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad3df269b682ccdffbdd9b3e25cf2973e0b6e71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(55) }}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"53\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Steven Chen (Professor Chen Education Palace, www.professorchenedu.com)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/vdj1kCgjHXk\">https://youtu.be/vdj1kCgjHXk</a>\n</p><p>~Steven Chen (Professor Chen Education Palace, www.professorchenedu.com)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II\" title=\"2024 AIME II\">2024 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2024 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2024\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2024 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017213156\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 231/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5524/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.766      1 -total\n 61.27%    7.822      1 Template:AIME_box\n 37.08%    4.734      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:27009:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017213156 and revision id 219272. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}